  "name": "Phantom: Lorelei",
  "desc": "Once a remnant creature in Nimbus Sanctum, Lorelei gained intelligence through Sentinel Imperator's power, entrusted to purify corrupted frequencies drifting in the clouds.",
  "desc_open": "This enemy has a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Dark>Havoc DMG</color>.\n\nOnce a remnant creature in Nimbus Sanctum, Lorelei gained intelligence through Sentinel Imperator's power, entrusted to purify corrupted frequencies drifting in the clouds.\n\nYet wicked desires have transformed her into the \"Queen of the Night,\" seeking to cloak the Sanctum in endless darkness to clear all sins.\n\nWith her final grasp on reason, Lorelei sealed herself within the atrium, where she sings a haunting lament, awaiting one who can awaken her from this dismal slumber.",
